==Hardstyle Republic==
Aril is known as 'Ajam' the Gambler in the [[Melbourne Shuffle]] group 'Hardstyle Republic'. Outside of Malaysian showbiz, he has his own shuffling scene fan-base who are international followers from YouTube.

